The old abandoned house at the end of the street would always hold a special place in Alice's heart. It was there that she had discovered the power of kindness and the impact that a single act of courage could have, a lesson she would carry with her always. And she would always remember the two children who had changed her life forever, a memory she would cherish for all time.
